{
  "content": {
    "en_us": "Reclaimed industrial oil can be obtained through [[processing|Chemical Plant]] [[industrial oil|Industrial Oil]]. It can be used as an ingredient in [[petroil|Petroil]] or as a [[fuel|Fuels]] source for supplemental power.<br><br>{{hbm:fluids/template_oil1}}",
